{% assign chart_zh = false %}
{% if page.lang == 'zh' %}{% assign chart_zh = true %}{% endif %}
<figure
  class="ar-chart"
  data-chart="{{ include.kind }}"
  data-source="slopcode-{{ include.kind }}-data"
  {% if include.kind == 'trajectory' %}
    data-extra-source="slopcode-periodic-data"
  {% endif %}
  data-lang="{{ page.lang }}"
  aria-labelledby="slopcode-{{ include.kind }}-caption"
  hidden
>
  <figcaption id="slopcode-{{ include.kind }}-caption">
    {% if include.kind == 'trajectory' %}
      {% if chart_zh %}三种策略的复杂度轨迹{% else %}Three strategies, different complexity trajectories{% endif %}
    {% elsif include.kind == 'refactor' %}
      {% if chart_zh %}六次独立重构，复杂度均下降{% else %}All six refactoring runs reduced peak complexity{% endif %}
    {% else %}
      {% if chart_zh %}复杂度与成本的反转{% else %}The complexity–cost crossover{% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </figcaption>
  <p class="ar-chart-subtitle">
    {% if include.kind == 'trajectory' %}
      {% if chart_zh %}
        Claude Opus 5.5 · circuit_eval · 8 关 · 最高函数复杂度（CC）
      {% else %}
        Claude Opus 5.5 · circuit_eval · 8 checkpoints · Peak function complexity (CC)
      {% endif %}
    {% elsif include.kind == 'refactor' %}
      {% if chart_zh %}
        Claude Opus 5.5 · 第 4 关快照 · 六次 refactor_only 会话
      {% else %}
        Claude Opus 5.5 · Checkpoint 4 snapshots · Six refactor_only sessions
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      {% if chart_zh %}
        circuit_eval · 完整 8 关 · 复杂度与费用分别比较，均为越低越好
      {% else %}
        circuit_eval · All 8 checkpoints · Separate scales; lower is better on both
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </p>
  <div class="ar-chart-plot"></div>
  <p class="ar-chart-note">
    {% if include.kind == 'trajectory' %}
      {% if chart_zh %}
        实线为 3 次运行的均值，阴影为最小–最大范围，并非置信区间。虚线为单次定期重构；方形标记 C2、C4、C6 的重构后数值。
        悬停或用左右方向键查看各关数据；<a href="#slopcode-periodic-data">定期重构原始轨迹见前表</a>。
      {% else %}
        Solid lines: means of 3 runs; shading: observed min–max, not confidence intervals. Dashed line: 1 periodic-refactoring run; squares mark
        post-refactor values at C2, C4 and C6. Hover or use the arrow keys for checkpoint values;
        <a href="#slopcode-periodic-data">periodic source data appear above</a>.
      {% endif %}
    {% elsif include.kind == 'refactor' %}
      {% if chart_zh %}
        空心圆为重构前，实心圆为重构后，数值越低越好。六次会话均保持了原有测试结果，包括重构前已失败的测试。悬停或聚焦任一行查看详情。
      {% else %}
        Open circles: before; filled circles: after. Lower is better. All six sessions preserved existing test results, including pre-existing
        failures. Hover or focus a row for details.
      {% endif %}
    {% else %}
      {% if chart_zh %}
        条形表示均值。定期重构仅 1 次运行，通过率为 90.5%；其他策略各 3 次运行。悬停或聚焦条形查看通过率与范围；原始表格保留在下方。
      {% else %}
        Bars show means. Periodic refactoring has only 1 run, with a 90.5% pass rate; all other strategies have 3 runs. Hover or focus a bar for pass
        rates and ranges; the source table follows.
      {% endif %}
    {% endif %}
  </p>
</figure>
